### 1.7 Edge Cases

| Scenario | Behavior |
|----------|----------|
| Device has no fingerprint hardware | Skip fingerprint in onboarding, go straight to PIN on exit |
| Teacher hasn't enrolled any fingerprint in Android Settings | Onboarding blocks and guides to Settings |
| Fingerprint sensor broken / disabled after setup | `canAuthenticate()` returns error → fall straight to PIN |
| Wet fingers / repeated failures | System BiometricPrompt handles retry UI; after lockout → PIN |
| Concurrent biometric prompt shown | Guard against double-launch with boolean flag |

