## Feature 2 — AI Attendance Guard: "No Students Enrolled" Popup

### 2.1 Goal
Prevent AI Attendance from starting when no students are enrolled (face biometrics). Show a contextual popup:
- **0 students in class** → "Please add or import students first"
- **Students exist but 0 enrolled** → "No facial biometrics registered yet" + option to switch to Manual Attendance

### 2.2 Implementation

**In [`AttractViewModel.kt:249-252`](file:///c:/Users/amitk/OneDrive/Documents/ChatGPT/Attract%20-%20Face%20Based%20Attendance%20Tracker/app/src/main/java/com/attract/attendance/feature/app/AttractViewModel.kt#L249-L252):**

```kotlin
fun openFaceAttendance(sessionDate: String) {
    val workspace = _uiState.value.workspace ?: return
    val totalStudents = workspace.students.size
    val enrolledCount = workspace.students.count { 
        it.enrollmentStatus == EnrollmentStatus.ENROLLED 
    }

    if (enrolledCount == 0) {
        _uiState.update {
            it.copy(noEnrolledStudentsWarning = NoEnrolledStudentsDialogState(
                classId = workspace.summary.id,
                sessionDate = sessionDate,
                totalStudents = totalStudents,
                enrolledCount = 0
            ))
        }
        return
    }
    // Proceed normally
    _uiState.update { it.copy(screen = AppScreen.FaceAttendance(workspace.summary.id, sessionDate)) }
}
```

**Dialog in [`AttractApp.kt`](file:///c:/Users/amitk/OneDrive/Documents/ChatGPT/Attract%20-%20Face%20Based%20Attendance%20Tracker/app/src/main/java/com/attract/attendance/feature/app/AttractApp.kt):**
- If `totalStudents == 0`: Title "No Students Found", buttons: "Go to Students" / "Dismiss"
- If `totalStudents > 0 && enrolledCount == 0`: Title "No Students Enrolled for AI", buttons: "Use Manual Attendance" / "Dismiss"

